<h2 id=3D"3">console: making OCaml CLI tools look good!</h2>
<div class=3D"outline-text-2" id=3D"text-3">
<p>
Archive: <a href=3D"https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/ann-console-making-ocaml-cl=
i-tools-look-good/18671/1">https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/ann-console-making-o=
caml-cli-tools-look-good/18671/1</a>
